nd canonical finding deduplication rather than claiming them as new inventions. Inspect full bounded-surface-residue-transfer and source-bound-joining-trial implementations in the handoff; record exact implementation revisions and reused components, or explicitly record why each is inapplicable. Do not assume their private schemas or permission to manipulate this specimen.\\\\nInterface: assess(specimenId, actuatorRef, supportRef, receiverRef optional, evidenceRefs); begin(assessmentId, optional targetComponentRef); resume(processId); cancel(processId). Assessment costs one active round and 0.5 energy, with no material consumed or tool wear. Validate ownership, local reach, unreserved source, actual actuator availability and energy before charging. A paid assessment must include real current examination or safe positioning/contact-clearance measurement, not merely print a prerequisite list. If no executable examination/contact is possible, reject that invocation before charging and return unmet prerequisites without a finding reward. No travel or free acquisition is included. Require independently usable actual actuator geometry and a stable reachable support; a represented hand may qualify only if actual anatomy, availability and body geometry support this bounded operation. Never infer an internal-access tool from generic agency. Optional stone item-131-lin-766 is a single rounded piece, diameter 0.12, blunting 0.004; it is not automatically a probe, gripper or support. This release permits no stone impact, abrasion, levering or newly fabricated tool. Branches and vine remain untouched. Receiver is required before any possible displacement outside the retained assembly; an actual suitable retaining hand may qualify only if independently available and geometrically verified, not simultaneously assigned incompatible support/actuator roles. Otherwise require an exact reachable receiver with verified retention geometry. No free container or prepared surface.\\\\nBefore physical execution, the development handoff must implement a versioned, deterministic local geometry/contact model of this already opened source and actual nominated actuator/support. Reuse represented geometry and exposure; do not enlarge the opening, infer clearance from visibleRegion=0.2, or treat sourceFractions as anatomical measurements. Newly introduced model assumptions must be labelled assumptions, not historical observations. Resolve clearance only to supported spatial precision, no finer than the existing 0.02 resolution and 0.01 uncertainty without an implemented finer observation mechanism. Where clearance is within uncertainty, report unresolved and do not insert an actuator. Retention or loosening requires actual contact response with explicit finite compliance, displacement and retention predicates in executable code; lack of those predicates is an unmet prerequisite, not inferred separability. A feasible first release can stop after actual safe clearance/contact testing if no represented loose component exists.\\\\nBegin reserves the single source assembly, actual actuator, support and, when required, receiver against conflicting use. Physical work is at most two active rounds, 0.5 energy each: first a slow, non-impact contact/clearance test; second, only if permitted by its findings, a low-displacement retention test or transfer of one already loose accessible component. Bound actuator travel to 0.02 world-distance per round and one contacted target. Force/effort must be explicitly capped in the implemented source/actuator model and below its represented fracture threshold; if a safe cap cannot be established, do not perform a loading step. No tearing, cutting, prying, crushing or renewed striking. Contact without a justified safe model is not authorized. Publish the computed action, exact references, maximum allocation, energy/time and wear quote before commitment. A changed source or method invalidates that quote. At most 2 rounds/1 energy of physical work, plus 1 round/0.5 energy assessment per trial; no automatic retries. Observation-only failed access never masquerades as completed physical work.\\\\nAllocate the actual quantity-1 assembly, not additional stock. Its source-unit ledger initially totals 1, with existing accounting fractions covering=0.35 and interior=0.65; those are bookkeeping, not edible yields. Optional transfer is restricted to an individually represented loose component of at most 0.05 source units, with its actual represented amount recorded rather than fabricated to meet the cap. If inventory supports only tenths, retain finer component accounting within the original assembly/process and receiver records; never round a tiny portion into an extra inventory unit. Reduce retained source allocation by exactly the transferred amount. Track all displaced material, residue and fragments by source, component, amount, location and custody; retained plus transferred plus deposited plus explicitly tracked environmental loss must equal the original allocation. Do not delete material or duplicate shell/interior identities. Unexpected fragmentation immediately stops further work, preserves every represented fragment/residue and records loss locations or an explicitly unresolved material balance; it cannot produce a successful separation report. Tool wear is zero for this release's nonabrasive contact model; any model predicting wear falls outside the quote and must stop before that step.\\\\nEach paid work round atomically records energy, source revision, physical changes, completedWork and remainingWork. Pause on lost reach, insufficient energy, invalid support/receiver, uncertain clearance, condition change or dangerous motion before another charge. Resume validates the exact process and surviving source state, never resets contacts or repeats paid work. Cancellation releases unused reservations once, leaves actual material at its real locations, preserves irreversible changes and returns no spent energy or time. Unused reserved material is released, not newly refunded or remotely returned. Death stops work and releases reservations under ordinary ownership/location rules, preserving fragments and paid progress. Study and completed work have no refund; invalid precommit operations consume no action energy or materials. Ordinary ageing continues during actual elapsed rounds and paused processes, with no condition restoration. No passive progress, automatic inspection, replenishment or ongoing maintenance benefit. Rechecking prerequisites is required after relevant changes. Development/review waiting itself advances no world time.\\\\nProducts are dated private source-specific findings and only such actual relocated component or residue as the work creates. Record separate statuses for clearance, actual contact, observed retention, attempted movement, actual detached/loose transfer and unresolved questions. An informative physical failure may be reported without implying successful access. No food identification, edible fraction, preparation requirement, safety certification, toxin conclusion, ingestion, satiety or nutrition effect follows. Other participants must independently communicate and act; no remote knowledge, consent, labor or hidden resources are supplied. Established validation, accounting, stopping and reward rules execute in code rather than repeated model adjudication.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":2,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Lin studies individually for two active rounds at 0.2 energy per round; learning supplies neither materials nor mastery in advance. Evaluate functional observations separately from enjoyment. Only genuinely verified, personally applicable new clearance/contact/retention findings, including informative physical failures, may invoke the existing grounded-understanding rule: short source 0.8, cap 1, duration 8 rounds, cooldown 12 rounds; maintained satisfaction gain 0.035 with decay 0.0015 under that existing rule. If that rule is unavailable, award zero rather than inventing a reward account. Canonical source/property/state/method-equivalence deduplication spans exterior assessments, opening inspections and this trial. An unavailable mechanism, uncharged validation error, printed prerequisite, request, naming, registration, study, completion marker or repeated unchanged finding earns nothing. No separate pleasure or practice reward is introduced. Familiar legitimate practice is not disqualified merely for lacking novelty, but any such benefit requires an existing applicable event rule and cannot stack for the same event. No physical-comfort effect is implemented; its global cap remains 10. Basic nutrition, protected reward accounts, budget, goals and permissions remain unchanged.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Reuse the source specimen renderer and add reusable event-driven metadata for trialId, sourceId, sourceRevision, componentRef, actuatorRef, supportRef, receiverRef, phase, completedWork, remainingWork, observed displacement, material allocations and outcome. Emit observable events only for actual positioning/contact/movement, interruption and actual material deposits; detailed measurements and reports remain personal until communicated. A reach or clearance preview is a dashed nonphysical annotation, never a supplied tool or receiver. Render retained assembly, real transferred component and real residue at their actual locations without duplicating quantity. Use distinct pending, blocked, paused, cancelled, contact-observed, transfer-completed and fragmentation-stopped states. Display transfer success only after conserved material actually reaches the validated receiver; uncertain access, failed tests and incomplete actions cannot show a separated product or success animation. No edible, safe, nutritious or mastery badge and no hidden decay disclosure.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

